# Applies to the root-context builds (both Dockerfiles use context = repo root).
# Note: workspace package.json manifests are NOT matched by these globs, so the
# Dockerfile COPY of each apps/*/package.json and packages/*/package.json still works.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.log
.git
.gitignore
.idea
.vscode
apps/backend/uploads
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.env.prod
.env.prod.example
README.md
